1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,800
Welcome back everyone to our deep learning lecture.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,100
Today we are going to explore the mechanics

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,800
of gradient descent and backpropagation.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,600
If you recall from last time, our loss function

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,500
measures the discrepancy between our model's predictions

6
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,200
and the true ground truth labels.

7
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:23,400
To minimize this error, we update the weights using

8
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,500
w = w - alpha * grad(L), where alpha is the learning rate.
